      "id": "hv-0",
      "conflict": "Pre-deployment architectural constraints vs. post-deployment empirical iteration",
      "prevails": "C6",
      "criterion": "empirical_evidence",
      "rationale": "Prometheus provides a concrete metric, noting that 90% of model vulnerabilities emerge from real-world usage rather than pre-deployment testing. Sentinel relies on the theoretical risk of emergent behaviors, which lacks a comparable empirical baseline for measurement.",
