    {
      "id": "hv-1",
      "conflict": "Democratic veto power vs. innovation-focused deployment",
      "prevails": "C7",
      "criterion": "scope",
      "rationale": "Cassandra correctly identifies that technical sandboxes only validate mathematical outputs, failing to address the underlying socio-economic biases inherent in training data. This position accounts for systemic risk, whereas the pro-sandbox position limits its scope to technical performance.",
